	<name>2200 Bancroft Way · North · 550 units · Under Construction · loop</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Standalone building loop, generated by scripts/gen_building_loop.py. Plan view 238 m -> spiral -> 1.2 turns -> eye level 90 m at radius 60 m. Altitudes derive from this building's extrusion height (79.5 m), so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Load alongside geometry.kml.]]></description>
